# Run into the gap in the floor of level 2 five times, with the same run each life, and then wait one more frame.
# After the fifth death the original starts a new game at once (chuckie.c:1139-1144), with the bonus of the level it reached and
# zero_bonus still set. The port shows its game-over screen instead, so every field differs on the last frame.
# The report pins that frame, so a port that replays the level at no lives, or restarts the game, would differ from it.
